<section image-layout="blank" id="1mp6H32b8e"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="S-Efe58Nvt"><h2>The next-quarter plan links each action to an outcome</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Quarter-end targets · Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="yuTU44RqEe" colspan="15"><p font-size="28pt"><b>$26.0M</b></p><h4>Revenue</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="8FtPwYyi9u" colspan="15"><p font-size="28pt"><b>62%</b></p><h4>Gross margin</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="3PF9u5FUj-" colspan="15"><p font-size="28pt"><b>109%</b></p><h4>Retention</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="2jkHmStH3Z" colspan="15"><p font-size="28pt"><b>+$0.2M</b></p><h4>Free cash flow</h4></grid-item></grid><h3>Action-to-outcome map</h3><table col-widths="[15,33,28,24]" borders="rows" striped="false"><tr><th><p>Timing</p></th><th><p>Action</p></th><th><p>Leading evidence</p></th><th><p>Outcome moved</p></th></tr><tr><td><p><b>Days 1–30</b></p></td><td><p>Staff the onboarding pod; publish pricing rules.</p></td><td><p>Pod staffed; pricing-compliance baseline set.</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Onboarding time<br/>Gross margin</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Days 31–60</b></p></td><td><p>Reduce backlog; activate expansion plays.</p></td><td><p>Onboarding trends to 14 days; expansion coverage is live.</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Retention</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Quarter end</b></p></td><td><p>Scale only interventions that moved leading indicators.</p></td><td><p>Guardrails hold and cash is positive.</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Revenue · margin<br/>Retention · cash</p></td></tr></table></grid-item></grid></section>